LAB 04 – Automation Ladder (Loop & Conditional Statements)
Aim
To generate random machine-part diameters and automate their quality inspection using loops and conditional statements.
Key Concepts
Random Module: Generates random diameters between 24.90 and 25.10.
For Loop: Repeats the inspection process for multiple parts.
If-Else: Classifies parts into three categories:
ACCEPT: Diameter between 24.95 and 25.05.
REWORK: Diameter within 24.90–25.10 but outside the accepted range.
SCRAP: Diameter outside the permitted range.
Counters: Count accepted, rework and rejected parts.
While Loop: Continues production until five consecutive accepted parts are achieved.
Important Learning
Halt Mode stops production when a scrap part is detected.
Skip Mode records the scrap part but continues production.
A safety limit prevents an infinite loop.
Result
Learned to automate machine-part inspection using loops, conditions and counters.
